# Eternalize (CR 702.129a): Bot1 discards Fanatic of Rhonas to Faithless Looting on turn 1, then pays {2}{G}{G} and exiles
# it from the graveyard for a token that is a copy of it, except it is a black 4/4 Zombie with no mana cost (CR 707.9b).
# The token keeps its other types and its printed abilities, so it is a Snake Druid Zombie that taps for {G}, and a
# 4/4 now, so its ferocious mana is on offer once it is out. The card itself stays in exile.

